      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "MESSENGER.\nAll hail, my lords! Which of this princely train\nCall ye the warlike Talbot, for his acts\nSo much applauded through the realm of France?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
